# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated databases
# recoveros_demo.db is rebuilt from scratch on every `run_demo`;
# recoveros.db is created on first API start. Neither belongs in git.
# The -wal and -shm siblings appear because SQLite runs in WAL mode.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

